    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a visual novel that enjoys several bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It depicts the horror of the protagonist who is on the run from people who have gone berserk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend who was close to her just a moment ago becomes a vicious serial killer, just like in a horror movie, and attacks her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy girl takes other people by the hand without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard to tell who is friend and who is foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible tension and fear will strike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently only available as a \u201cprologue,\u201d and the ending is a bad one, but it is a complete story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a game to enjoy the cruel and unpleasant bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to add several new stories in additional episodes in the future, most of which will have bad endings.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a visual novel that enjoys several bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It depicts the horror of the protagonist who is on the run from people who have gone berserk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A friend who was close to her just a moment ago becomes a vicious serial killer, just like in a horror movie, and attacks her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creepy girl takes other people by the hand without hesitation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is hard to tell who is friend and who is foe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An incredible tension and fear will strike you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently only available as a \u201cprologue,\u201d and the ending is a bad one, but it is a complete story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a game to enjoy the cruel and unpleasant bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We plan to add several new stories in additional episodes in the future, most of which will have bad endings.</p>",
    "short_description": "Now, taste the infinite despair! People in a town suddenly turn violent due to unexplained symptoms. This is a story about enjoying the bad endings that befall high school students.",
